Based on the SceneDesignerAgent's sandbox report, I have all the information needed to design the milestone. The lectern is placed at spawn-relative coordinates (5, 1, 6) inside a library building. The task is "find lectern" — a find/locate/observe task where the player needs to navigate to and visually identify the lectern.

